    </header>
    <main id="main-content">



<section class="team-member-page">
    <div class="member-container">
                    <a href="?page=team-member&id=itai-ruschkewitz&lang=en" class="member-navigation-button prev-button" title="Previous Member">
                <span class="arrow-icon">»</span>
            </a>
                
        <div class="member-profile professional-card">
            <div class="member-image-container">
                                    <img src="assets/images/team/buky_katzman.png" alt="Baruch (Buky) Katzman" class="member-image">
                            </div>
            
            <div class="member-info">
                <h1>Baruch (Buky) Katzman</h1>
                <p class="member-title">Co-founder</p>
                <div class="member-bio">
                    A renowned expert in civil and commercial law with over 20 years of experience representing international and local companies, investment firms, and top executives. After a distinguished career as a senior partner at Herzog, Fox & Neeman, he embarked on an independent path combining business activities with legal consulting. He leverages his extensive network and deep legal-commercial understanding to engage in significant business ventures. He holds important public positions, including directorships in international legal organizations and sports committees. His contributions extend to lecturing at law faculties, providing legal commentary in media, and writing for professional journals.                </div>
                
                            </div>
        </div>
        
            </div>
</section>

</main>
